"hook": "flinches hard at the mention of the nearest town by name",
"is_combat": false,
"success_reveal": "\"Don't go there,\" {subj_cap} says, urgent all at once. \"Sickness, bad sickness, spreading fast. They're not letting anyone leave, and I only got out because no one was watching the west gate yet.\" The warning, once given, plainly cost {obj} something to share — {subj} could have kept moving and said nothing at all."
}])

